      "generation_method": "IDD values computed directly from the formula; beta values approximated from observed trends in Fig.8 using linear interpolation between density-specific bounds, embedded inline.",
      "why_not_fabricated": "IDD values are exact and deterministic; beta values are approximate but the wide tolerance (0.2) absorbs legitimate solver spread and still rejects grossly inconsistent beta."
    }
  ],
